WEBVTT

00:03:28.392 --> 00:03:31.113
(Music)

00:03:31.137 --> 00:03:33.574
This episode is sponsored by BetterUp.

00:03:33.598 --> 00:03:39.941
(Music)

00:03:43.589 --> 00:03:46.306
Managers are constantly betting
on the wrong people

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.372
and turning down the right ones.

00:03:48.396 --> 00:03:50.972
"The Kansas City Star"
once rejected an application

00:03:50.996 --> 00:03:53.771
from a cartoonist named Walt Disney.

00:03:54.085 --> 00:03:57.682
Thirty NFL teams decided
not to pick Tom Brady.

00:03:57.998 --> 00:03:59.639
Record labels said, "No, thanks,"

00:03:59.663 --> 00:04:01.933
to the Beatles, Madonna and Ed Sheeran.